python-avito-sdk (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.3.0: Dual live Telegram progress bars (overall + current link).
  * Full PyPy 3.11, PyPy 3.12, and Python 3.16 No-GIL (Free-Threaded) compatibility.
  * Automatic persistent rotating file logging to storage/logs/avito_sdk.log.
  * ASCII English logging for clean terminal output and cross-platform universality.
  * Anti-reboot card enrichment with allow_rotation flag preventing unnecessary modem reboots.
  * Adaptive micro-pacing for safe 8-worker concurrency on mobile proxies.

